    "regime_notes": "Strong positive relationship at 20d in 2025-2026 (IC 0.091925, ICIR 0.372985) and 2027-2028 (IC 0.033428, ICIR 0.118428), but reversed in the recent 2028-09-01 onward regime (IC -0.055319, ICIR -0.205120). Interpret as regime-sensitive and require correlation audit and monitoring before ensemble inclusion."
